What this directory contains
----------------------------
- gap_results.json, gap_interlevel.json,
  item7_obl1_hint_strata_by_partner.json: aggregate convention-gap
  statistics computed from games that were generated by running the
  released icml_OBL* checkpoints (self-play OBL1-5, OBL1 seed cross-play,
  and inter-level pairings) through the original OBL/HLE environment with
  per-step greedy acting. These aggregate results are released under
  CC BY 4.0 (see ../LICENSE-DATA).
- export_obl_games.py, gen_all.sh, gen_interlevel.sh, verify_replay.py,
  compute_gap_obl.py, compute_gap_interlevel.py: our generation and
  verification scripts (MIT, see ../LICENSE). They require a local build
  of the OBL codebase and the released checkpoints.
- license_check.json, obl_step0_audit_report.md: the license reading and
  the independent recomputation/engine-equivalence audit for provenance.

What this directory does NOT contain
------------------------------------
- The OBL source code, the model checkpoints, and the generated game logs
  are NOT redistributed here. The checkpoints are available from the
  official release only (models/download.sh in the repository above); the
  game logs are regenerable from the checkpoints with the scripts in this
  directory. This split follows the CC BY-NC 4.0 attribution and
  NonCommercial conditions.

